# Title menu (cursor starts on NEW GAME): D-pad down once to LOAD, then A. The human's demo used a 64 ms
# stick flick; a scripted 120 ms flick was missed once (2026-11-10: the A then opened NEW GAME), so this
# waits for the menu to settle and uses the D-pad with a longer hold.
800 -
200 DOWN        # NEW GAME -> LOAD
500 -
150 A           # open LOAD
300 -
